  "notes": "Cash basis, one village with governmental (General, Street, Other Governmental) and proprietary (Water, Sewer, Sanitation) funds. Governmental from Total column p4 (interest income and transfers printed under Other Financing Sources, below the printed total receipts, recorded as outside_printed_total; transfers in/out equal 90,612, printed in total column). Personnel services and operating expenses are by object, split by fund column (General -> general government, Street -> streets/highways). Business-type receipts/disbursements from p6; other receipts (disbursements) listed below total, marked outside_printed_total. Balance sheet uses Total column of cash-basis Statement of Net Position (p1) which combines governmental and proprietary; no liabilities. p8 budgetary all-funds schedule recorded as detail (only detail schedule). Read pages 1-8 of 8."
